# The glow of an own mesh under the GI probes (step 0 of the night-and-interiors note): the head of the wall torch
# at the "Red Lantern" (flame at 406 131 -3086, the wall behind it at +x) at midnight, particles hidden so that the
# embers in the folds of the tow are seen and the frames repeat. Four held views, a shot of each.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<the working content> OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1, once with the default (probes on an
# RTX card) and once with OPENGOTHIC_RT=0; compare with emissive_probes_compare.py.
# @timeout 240
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph pfx
cam lift off

set time 0 0
goto pos 400 -129 -2985
wait 3000
set time 0 0
cam at 405 138 -3040 405 124 -3086
wait 2500
shot side-close
wait 500
cam at 350 138 -3086 406 124 -3086
wait 2500
shot front-close
wait 500
cam at 405 150 -2985 405 140 -3085
wait 2500
shot side-1m
wait 500
cam at 305 145 -3085 405 140 -3085
wait 2500
shot front-1m
wait 500
